    "decision": "Reject the candidate; keep the accepted runtime at 6ced2eb.",
    "reason": "The full Decimal queries do not improve. DOUBLE is 0.976% slower and FLOAT is 0.559% slower in the fixed paired comparison; instructions rise 3.248% and 3.412%.",
