    "remaining_precision_gap": "Within the same experiment, the DOUBLE/FLOAT full-Decimal query difference is 18.452% before and 18.944% after. These queries are not semantically interchangeable in general.",
    "scope": "The prototype changes only strict Float32/Float64-to-Decimal output construction when no input values are NULL. It reuses the conversion, rounding, overflow and precision checks. Nullable and safe-mode kernels remain unchanged.",
